#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:10
#: b73616bb3fc5470481d081a2dada94d1
msgid ""
"项目已经将 CR3BP raw xlsx catalog 纳入仓库，并提供 importer 将 raw workbook 规范化为 "
"normalized catalog。DRO single-orbit Generate 已经有手动初值路径，也已有初步 catalog seed"
" propagation 能力。用户需要在 GUI 的 Generate 脚本中增加 catalog 初值选项：选择 catalog "
"中的初值，直接按 catalog 中记录的周期外推，生成现有 plot 流程可读取的 Orbit JSON。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:12
#: 48c0ac4483c04576bf7b3992aa41a7eb
msgid "约束条件："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:14
#: 23faa696561247e4b83b0faee88342e1
msgid ""
"v1 只接入 **DRO single-orbit Generate**，不扩大到其它 CR3BP orbit family，也不改 family"
" generation。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:15
#: 284b7616121342fbb3fd32349db111cd
msgid ""
"Catalog 模式使用 catalog state 和 catalog period 直接外推，不做 differential "
"correction，也不重新计算周期。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:16
#: afbea3468bda4417848243acb00afcb0
msgid "GUI 默认行为必须保持现有手动 DRO Generate 体验不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:17
#: 51fd98a422574436a88dd4a8fdcc86f0
msgid ""
"Normalized catalog 是 raw xlsx 的派生产物，可能不存在；GUI/CLI 需要能按需从 tracked raw xlsx"
" 生成。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:18
#: 8d1f7cb84fc147a4a8746075e072e958
msgid "GUI 的脚本扫描阶段必须保持轻量，不能在 `SCRIPT_ENTRY` 扫描阶段触发 catalog/importer 等重型加载。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:20
#: 59fd35cbfc7549a48504ebe320e8f593
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:22
#: 74a2e74231e94c43b9f1060df1768cba
msgid ""
"采用 DRO Generate 内嵌 catalog seed 模式，而不是新增独立 Generate from Catalog 脚本。GUI "
"增加可配置的 `Cr3bpCatalogSeedSelector`，v1 只配置 `orbit_type=\"dro\"`。该 selector "
"负责参考初值模式 UI、按参考记录编号搜索、轻量详情 preview、Jacobi 输入和校验；运行时仍输出 ordinary CLI "
"args，交给既有 run orchestrator，不改变脚本执行模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0002-dro-catalog-seed-gui-v1.md:24
#: bf77dbad8184444fa805c91e683e0042
msgid ""
"用户界面术语以 `CONTEXT.md` 为准：Reference Catalog 面向用户称为 **参考数据集**，catalog seed "
"面向用户称为 **参考初值**，Seed ID 面向用户称为 **参考记录编号**；`Seed ID`、`Catalog mode` "
"等仅作为代码/CLI/ADR 历史术语使用。"
msgstr ""

